        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Create Claw-managed workspace files",
        "body": "## Summary\n\nImplements the third [RFC #27](https://github.com/openclaw/rfcs/pull/27) slice, stacked on [#101755](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/101755):\n\n- Creates canonical bootstrap files and supporting `workspace.files` only inside the new Claw agent workspace.\n- Uses OpenClaw fs-safe roots with traversal, symlink, hardlink, nonregular-file, and size rejection.\n- Revalidates source content against the consented plan digest immediately before each write.\n- Uses create-only writes and never overwrites pre-existing content.\n- Persists a pending per-file owner row before each write, then records complete or failed status with canonical package-relative source and workspace-relative destination paths.\n- Defines the workspace ledger in OpenClaw's shared generated SQLite schema instead of creating an ad hoc runtime table.\n- Retains written-file evidence and marks the root install partial if a later file or provenance update fails.\n- Propagates the consented `planIntegrity` through complete and partial add results.\n\nPackage, MCP, and cron mutation remain blocked until their canonical owner slices. No declared component is silently skipped.\n\n## Stack\n\n- RFC: [openclaw/rfcs#27](https://github.com/openclaw/rfcs/pull/27)\n- Depends on: [#101328](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/101328) schema/source identity/read-only plan\n- Depends on: [#101755](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/101755) consented agent/workspace creation and root provenance\n- This PR: confined workspace files, hashes, and per-file ownership\n- Next: [#102228](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/102228) skill/plugin package owners\n\n## Validation\n\n```text\npnpm exec vitest run src/claws/workspace.test.ts src/claws/provenance.test.ts \\\n  src/cli/claws-cli.test.ts src/state/openclaw-state-db.test.ts\n# passed\n\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs run --config test/vitest/vitest.e2e.config.ts \\\n  src/claws/lifecycle.e2e.test.ts\n# lifecycle E2E passed\n\npnpm exec oxlint src/claws/add.ts src/claws/workspace.ts \\\n  src/claws/workspace.test.ts src/claws/lifecycle.e2e.test.ts\n# 0 warnings, 0 errors\n\npnpm tsgo:core\npnpm tsgo:test:src\ngit diff --check\n# passed\n```\n\nThe real CLI E2E previews the workspace Claw, applies the exact emitted plan in the same isolated state directory, and verifies `SOUL.md`, `HEARTBEAT.md`, and `reference/policy.md` plus their complete SQLite owner rows.\n\nCodex review of the final uncommitted patch completed with no actionable findings.",
